    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8802135c8a2f68339a1f5a5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。\n连我自己……也觉得完成了一份令人满意的工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd95cee901dede420408ae5a3f3ebe1f232985b572c405316e205e368c192b0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1456"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66156152eb4fc36652cf111",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……你的工作非常完美。\n我也很高兴能用自己的工作来回报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddaeca972a53f1ef7a28b1f8f5feb74fa359aad192c736e8b633d4ca69a8ed66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1457"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c1fd4c6c5f8207a2d4e032d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是呢～……啊，便利店的甜点！\n打算回去的时候买一点呢，呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bb9e4ea1bed12a1b99f2f38ee0929d98bbfa2e1af8e07f1caf410bf92ca462",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1458"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6fca696327e7f56150c5b30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸，是在为我……加油吗！？　哇……\n哇啊～……，太感谢大家了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9082fb0d5f2d46a2e137585e92e1576e6761585b713533aa1dc02c853648cb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1459"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad2ddcc014f93695030ab3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "家人！　每次，赛事结束后\n我们全家都会进行视频通话哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6499d5905cc9747d859ec93c6e169f6f6d77c05fc850a07b6a3fdfac9478f06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd162b5b684fdecb33d819ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是哪个项目，我都尽量\n多重复几次。直到身体适应为止，无论多少次！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc21f2fc08512dab3745c7a1cbd8d05aef33f40e1d37f0de6641a2dab7ce09f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8bbd5bf94aa61a6e78c4215",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我认为最重要的是，不断赢下去。\n为了成为主角……下一场，我也不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa45ea7be07f8e44de58ca371c166fda31583f43172e94af762fa8fa7e3d0c14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bd4e64dbac1f1b5e97ca70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "家人！　每次，赛事结束后\n我们全家都会进行视频通话哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6499d5905cc9747d859ec93c6e169f6f6d77c05fc850a07b6a3fdfac9478f06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
