    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9566deec4741408d279e22cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在看工作人员。看着他们工作时\\n手脚利落的模样，让我很感兴趣呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2282de700dd03d1d0c415d6942b75d80aaba1b34345d850840e83683d4083bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad747e89bb2fc8043550e6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有一家我一直很在意的荞麦面店！\n那种高格调的氛围，感觉很适合作为奖励呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a9a3f0cdd77872ece5ab25bf247297c3c98b5a529dbc3dc617974163bdeb09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1470"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2414ef2c2dcfa4fb72a9657",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，和贵妇人小姐一起做肌肉训练！\n那种打磨身体的感觉，真的非常开心♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "92fe028094353fc99ff6fb51513b90cd323f7a55a2fb615cfad80f59d8e8168e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b1502f4ade099f3696f64b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！　我会用胜利的景色，\n来回应大家的期待的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52178c52a1321267979fb32a1504a3a12b757fde7cbbfbdb00106eaccd286e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1472"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d5e5fed18a120f72382e3af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那就是好好聆听出赛前的声援。\n在起跑门里，心里也会感到很踏实哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4cb9abaac28526e1d2e68e0ff03c5cd16edba5eedac9a296f73ef0032873ffb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1473"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb351f21ab34a01bf0c82901",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，真的吗！　那如果对上视线的话\n我会向你挥手的哦！　呵呵，好期待啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbacd271c8c6c5580eafa141d5fd8084edcf02a49e3b50141258727100b7da96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1474"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97213fd97e21af046d0d5741",
